<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB groups wins Bahrain order.</title>
<headline>ABB groups wins Bahrain order.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical engineering group ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG said a consortium lead by ABB had won a $458 million turnkey contract to build a gas-fired power and desalination plant in Bahrain.</p>
<p>ABB's part of the order is valued at around $290 million, ABB said in a statement.</p>
</text>
